      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chino%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town began as Rancho Santa Ana del Chino, a Mexican land grant given to Antonio Maria Lugo in 1834, later subdivided into the Town of Chino in 1910.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        16,
        26,
